{"code":"measurementID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", authenticated by its ","type":"text"},{"code":"apiSecret","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", with ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLSession.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", retrying a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"send that fails for now with the waits of ","type":"text"},{"code":"backoff","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"code":"clock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/googleanalyticsencoding\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/googleanalytics(measurementid:apisecret:region:plan:backoff:clock:now:)","title":"googleAnalytics(measurementID:apiSecret:region:plan:backoff:clock:now:)"},"doc://GoogleAnalyticsEncoding/documentation/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError/appBundle":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The process is an app or an app extension: its main bundle is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".app"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".appex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directory. The factory is compiled for macOS so a server written for it can run there, and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Mac app compiles it too, but an app ships the API secret to everyone who installs it, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anyone holding the secret can send events to the property. Send the app’s events to a relay"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of yours instead, which forwards them to Google Analytics."}],"url":"\/documentation\/googleanalyticsencoding\/googleanalyticssetuperror\/appbundle","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"appBundle","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"GoogleAnalyticsSetupError.appBundle","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/appBundle","kind"